            "review_title": "Review at Hi-End coffee",
            "review_text": "Truongphan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nvery nice place of Saigon\nAug 2018 • Friends\nI came here with some friends to join a acoustic night. I was really surprised. Interior place was very nice, it was a typical and traditional place of Saigon. Acoustic was good but i thought singers should sang more English songs\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 26, 2018",
